DATA LICENCE NOTICE
===================

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the CODE in this repository only — the
Streamlit application under app/ and anything else executable. It confers no
rights whatsoever over the data.

Source data
-----------

The data published here originates with New Zealand government agencies and
remains under its publishers' licences, not under MIT. The publishers are:

  - the Ministry of Social Development (including StudyLink)
  - the Ministry of Education (Education Counts)
  - the Treasury

DATA_SOURCES.yaml is the authoritative record. For every dataset it states the
publisher, the source URL, the licence status, the date the files were retrieved
and exactly how the data was modified. ATTRIBUTION.md carries the same record in
readable form, grouped by publisher.

Licence status: unverified
--------------------------

No licence is recorded for any source dataset anywhere in this repository or in
the pipeline that produced it. New Zealand government statistical releases are
normally licensed CC BY 4.0 under NZGOAL, and that is the expectation for all
three publishers — but it is an expectation, not a verified fact, and it must
not be treated as one. Every dataset in DATA_SOURCES.yaml is flagged
licence_issue: true for this reason.

Anyone intending to redistribute this data, or to rely on it beyond reading this
demonstration, should confirm the licence on each publisher's own page first.

Modification
------------

The data has been modified. It was downloaded, staged as faithful cell grids,
resolved out of the publishers' worksheet layouts into a conformed mart, and
trimmed to the period range the application charts. Figures are reconciled
against the agencies' published totals, but this is not an official publication
of any agency and no agency has endorsed it. For any official purpose, consult
the agencies directly.

Generated data
--------------

The indicative geography centroids and H3 cells in DIM_GEOGRAPHY are not agency
data. They were authored for this repository because no agency publishes
coordinates alongside these statistics. They are demonstration-only reference
values, offered as CC0: they position a map marker and never change a count.

No synthetic or modelled statistical values exist anywhere in this platform.
